1. complaint services, consultation and counseling; accompaniment services;
health services;
legal aid services;
repatriation and social reintegration services; and 6. social rehabilitation services.
b. in addition to the forms of services regulated in letter a, special services are also provided which include: 1. pick-up services; and/or
2. medical and psychological referral services. Forms of services as referred to in paragraph (1) letter a and letter b, are implemented by Regional Apparatus (2) in accordance with minimum service standards established by the government.
